  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_TextID: 98023
  m_Text: 'Date of birth: September 23rd, 2310'
  m_TextDyn: 'Type: Toltech Weapon

    Experimental energy rifle based on

    technology from the UnitedCorps Labs

    features supra-conductive plasma

    projectiles fired at high rate

    and large capacity cell for long

    suppresive fire.'
